                                             rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nen2660/term#isConnectedTo>;
                                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The topological relationship between physical objects"@en;
                                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "is connected to"@en.
<https://w3id.org/nen2660/def#isDescribedBy> a rdf:Property,
