                                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "is described by"@en.
<https://w3id.org/nen2660/def#isImplementedBy> a rdf:Property,
                                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                               rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/nen2660/def#FunctionalEntity>;
                                               rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/nen2660/def#TechnicalEntity>;
                                               rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nen2660/term#isImplementedBy>;
                                               rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/nen2660/def#hasSolution>;
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The technical entity that implements a functional entity"@en;
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "is implemented by"@en.
<https://w3id.org/nen2660/def#isPlanFor> a rdf:Property,
                                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                         rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/nen2660/def#PlannedEntity>;
                                         rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/nen2660/def#RealizedEntity>;
                                         rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nen2660/term#isPlanFor>;
                                         <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A potentially realized entity according to this planned entity"@en;
                                         <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "is plan for"@en.
<https://w3id.org/nen2660/def#isRealizedBy> a rdf:Property,
                                              <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                            rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/nen2660/def#PlannedEntity>;
                                            rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/nen2660/def#RealizedEntity>;
                                            rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nen2660/term#isRealizedBy>;
                                            rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/nen2660/def#isPlanFor>;
                                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The realized entity that realizes a planned entity"@en;
                                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "is realized by"@en.
<https://w3id.org/nen2660/def#overConnection> a rdf:Property,
