                                              rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nen2660/term#participatesIn>;
                                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The interaction a physical object participates in"@en;
                                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "participates in"@en.
<https://w3id.org/nen2660/def#portion> a rdf:Property,
