                                                       rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nen2660/term#requirementSeverityType>;
                                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The possession of a severity type by a requirement"@en;
                                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "requirement severity type"@en.
<https://w3id.org/nen2660/def#requirementSourceType> a rdf:Property,
