                                                                             <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl>,
                                                                             <https://w3id.org/nen2660/rdfs/def>.
<https://w3id.org/nen2660/skos/term> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme>;
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <http://qudt.org/2.1/schema/qudt>,
                                                                             <http://qudt.org/2.1/vocab/quantitykind>,
                                                                             <http://qudt.org/2.1/vocab/unit>,
